  "implemented": [
    "Acquire the existing exclusive workspace advisory transaction lock after BEGIN/role/timeouts and before policy binding, source graph or record locks.",
    "Issuer ticket creation commits/releases before the main transaction waits. Main commit/rollback and release precede issuer ticket retirement.",
    "Normalize the already-validated workspace UUID before taking its lock.",
    "Preserve current post-wait policy/record/consent decisions and the prior identity cleanup/final-delivery fences.",
    "The consent race fixture observes a separate withdrawal waiting for the research transaction, then verifies subsequent research denial."
  ],
